# Text is stored and checked out with LF on every platform. Tests pin the hashes of fixture
# files, so an `autocrlf` checkout on Windows (CRLF) changed their bytes and failed them.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.splat binary
*.ply binary
*.spz binary
*.zip binary
